<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Intel EPS view raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Intel EPS view raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Donaldson, Lufkin &amp; Jenrette raised its 1997 earnings estimate on Intel Corp to $8.50 a share from $7.60 a share, a market source said.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
